<section class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-[#121413] text-center relative border-t border-[#5C6B73]/20">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 grid-precision opacity-20"></div>
  
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[#5C6B73] opacity-30 mb-8">format_quote</span>
    
    <div class="relative p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-16">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-8 h-8 border-t border-l border-[#5C6B73]/30"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-8 h-8 border-b border-r border-[#5C6B73]/30"></div>

      <p class="text-lg md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-[#F2F4F6] font-light leading-relaxed mb-10 font-manrope">
        "La precisión técnica en EXERIS redefinió mi concepto de atención
        médica. Un procedimiento impecable con tecnología que inspira total
        confianza."
      </p>
      
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[#F2F4F6] font-syncopate uppercase tracking-wider">
          ROBERTO M.
        </h4>
        <p class="text-[8px] text-[#5C6B73] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mt-2 font-space">
          PACIENTE // CIRUGÍA LAPAROSCÓPICA
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Indicators -->
    <div class="flex justify-center gap-3 mt-12">
      <button class="w-16 h-[1px] bg-[#5C6B73]"></button>
      <button class="w-16 h-[1px] bg-[#5C6B73]/20 hover:bg-[#5C6B73]/50 transition-colors"></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
